  "title": "Sinclair Declares $0.25 Per Share Quarterly Cash Dividend",
  "summary": "BALTIMORE, Aug. 05, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) — Sinclair, Inc. (Nasdaq: SBGI) announced that its Board of Directors has declared a quarterly cash dividend of $0.25 per share on the Company’s Class A and Class B common stock. The dividend is payable on September 15, 2026, to the holders of record at the close of business...",
